From 71d6b99ec42a0be77c0bb253282dbef8871cc5dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:27:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tools/dvbridge: a copyright line on the files of Hades

The files that Hades wrote in tools/dvbridge (the cache of GPU programs,
the check of the bytes that are sent, the rule for MEL streams and the
signal of a certified source device) carried only their licence line,
while the other files of Hades in Kodi name their author and say that
they are not in Kodi as Team Kodi publishes it. They now say so too, with
their licence as it was (GPL-3.0-or-later, the licence of the bridge,
which LICENSES/README.md names). The files that came from CroqueMr's fork
keep their headers as the fork wrote them.
---
 tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_cache.c  | 8 +++++++-
 tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_cache.h  | 8 +++++++-
 tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_mel.h    | 8 +++++++-
 tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_source.c | 8 +++++++-
 tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_source.h | 8 +++++++-
 tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_verify.c | 8 +++++++-
 tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_verify.h | 8 +++++++-
 7 files changed, 49 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_cache.c b/tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_cache.c
index 3aac4d7..90bfa1b 100644
--- a/tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_cache.c
+++ b/tools/dvbridge/dvbridge_cache.c
@@ -1,4 +1,10 @@
-/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later */
+/*
+ *  Copyright (C) 2026 Hades
+ *  This file is part of LibreELEC Hades. It is not in Kodi as Team Kodi publishes it.
+ *
+ *  SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
+ *  See LICENSES/README.md for more information.
+ */
